  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object is launched with an initial speed of <em>v </em>at an angle <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span> to the horizontal. Air resistance is negligible. P is the highest point of the motion of the object.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the change in the vertical and the horizontal speed of the object between its starting point and point P?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Change in horizontal speed</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Change in vertical speed</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n<td><em>v </em>sin<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n<td><em>v </em>cos<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><em>v </em>sin<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span></td>\n<td><em>v </em>cos<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><em>v </em>cos<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span></td>\n<td><em>v </em>sin<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
